   <patchobj type="patch/object" uuid="a4813a02-e8cc-5c1d-a357-de3ddcbef4c5" name="panel" x="20" y="160">
      <params/>
      <attribs>
         <combo attributeName="midich" selection="omni"/>
         <combo attributeName="clock" selection="slave"/>
         <combo attributeName="lfade" selection="in+out"/>
         <combo attributeName="lquant" selection="off"/>
         <combo attributeName="lburst" selection="off"/>
         <combo attributeName="lonly" selection="off"/>
      </attribs>
      <object id="patch/object" uuid="a4813a02-e8cc-5c1d-a357-de3ddcbef4c5">
         <sDescription>Gills front panel for the Microcosm-style engine: pots with soft takeover, SHIFT layer on the encoder switch, tap tempo, preset selection, OLED text and LEDs. MIDI: CC64 hold, CC80 bypass, CC81-84 looper/tap, CC85 reverse, CC86 undo, plus the CC chart of the pedal (5-21, 23-31, 34, 35, 47, 48, 93, 102); Program Change 1-44 as in the pedal chart. midich: MIDI channel (omni = all). clock: slave = tempo and rhythm grid follow MIDI clock. lfade: looper fade shape. lquant: loop length rounded to quarter notes. lburst: LOOP REC records only while held. lonly: the effect is bypassed, only the looper works.</sDescription>
         <author>Claude for Ksoloti Gills</author>
         <license>BSD</license>
